OL,3,GNEWSABurnham to visit Scotland during
OL,4,ASNP conference
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt will come less than three weeks
OL,7,Fafter Burnham told the Labour Party
OL,8,Fconference that he was determined to
OL,9,Fprove wrong Swinney's claim that he
OL,10,Fwould be the UK's last prime minister.
